Project Design

System Architecture

The Auto Ticket Classification System follows a simple workflow where the user submits a support ticket, the system processes the ticket description, and the classification model predicts the appropriate category.

System Workflow

User
↓
Submit Ticket
↓
Ticket Description
↓
Text Preprocessing
↓
Classification Model
↓
Category Prediction
↓
Display Result

Main Modules

1. Ticket Submission

The user submits a support ticket with the required details and problem description.

2. Text Preprocessing

The ticket description is cleaned and processed before classification.

3. Ticket Classification

The processed ticket is given to the classification model.

4. Category Prediction

The system predicts the most suitable category for the ticket.

5. Result Display

The predicted category is displayed to the user.
